1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,662
Good notes are not a copy of the lecture; they are a record of your thinking.

2
00:00:04,612 --> 00:00:08,637
Use short symbols and leave space to add ideas later.

3
00:00:08,637 --> 00:00:12,400
Write questions in the margin when something is unclear.

4
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:16,425
Review your notes within twenty-four hours to keep them useful.

